            "review_title": "Review at Chez PLISSON",
            "review_text": "rohitjangid2015\nRangsit, Thailand20 contributions\n0\nNice place for Pixzas in Bien Hoa, Dong Nai\nJul 2016 • Friends\nWent with 3 friends. This place serves pizza, spagettis and pastas. Ordered pizza and spagettis. Pizzas were more than thin base, crispy and seemed freshly baked. Spagettis was a little disappointing ,the sauce was little thin. Service was prompt. We ordered for around 600,000 dong for 3 people with 2 medium pizzas,1 spagettis and drinks. \nPS: we all 3 were Indians ,kindly use your conversion palate factor for the place.\nRead more\nWritten July 3, 2016",
